        "text": "**What is confirmed**: Enterprise AI analytics platform Nebuly (Turin/NYC) raised a $21 million (€19M) Series A round led by Planven, with participation from Exor Ventures, Tenacity Capital, TGVG Capital, Fastweb+Vodafone, and CDP Venture Capital"
